<title>SOUTH AFRICA: FOREIGNERS BUY 286.21 MLN RAND S.AFRICA BONDS TUES.</title>
<headline>FOREIGNERS BUY 286.21 MLN RAND S.AFRICA BONDS TUES.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners bought a net 286.21 million rands worth of South African bonds on Tuesday after buying 80.76 million rands on Monday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
